<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants killed six civilians in Nangade and forced peasant farmers to abandon fields in Cabo Delgado, limiting humanitarian access. Opposition leader Mondlane reported state abuses during a Supreme Court trial and denied ordering the destruction of road-toll infrastructure. Temporary tents have restored healthcare services for more than 7 thousand people in Marrangira, Niassa. The EU has extended military aid to Mozambique through 2028, supporting the government’s LNG megaproject and port expansion despite the insecurity. 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOa0pwR0dzRlhEVTFyZ1RnZ2F3QXFIZGlUTE1WbU1feGcxZDBtckhZOHB4dUJjSHJXWjk4czkxSUo5d280bmc3bURsMVhLNDVuNV83ZVNVVThRZU5zUE5XWmZwVHNzQUlVM0ltelFDRGhCdWlkV1hLQ2Q3U2ZhOUlyN0FTVjJ5RWZ1VEZhM0h4SGRmbnVFZGlCTkVrNXhUY3FETG54b3A0N05qekc1M2VpUDJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1xNkxaRW04RWpkc1RrOV9zNW1GeGVWVUlxdEVWSzlGTHJSRi13enF4S2QyOElKcktSazdzYWFmNl9Kbkh6dVpBQmVWTG44akV3NkFxUGhpVzVpTjhaaGtNbnZWZl9ZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNMmxQaG9neXUyc3lnS1h2ZlZ0SnlDRTJXTTNkRVdhMXhDX1hBblVsTnJIdWdHM3VFN3J6ZVVjaHZwU2lUdk1jVzhEQ3RyS2RIZ2FONW9MX3R0S0ZqYnFmSTJ3THp6aTlTRnk5LWFncU13WWNRUi1wdFE3NGZ2aWhLWDBTQS1xd25HY1NyVDVhTlIwZW5aTnBtZTVTYzBZWGUydThSbkszVEQ0TmlZM3I0Mw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5kNjhLMU9QTXdpNlJ4YzdkOUZncmVqSkdUQXEwMmk3aDNTYTJuSDdjcnRYUEFhOGF6aXEtbFpKN0d2cG5ncFJZTWhfN0NldUQtLTM3ZE1KaE